                                "sense_id": "df430fc7-7fdf-3ab1-874c-b74586f232d8",
                                "text": "[…] exultingly cried Lord Carhampton, stealing an underlook at Maurice O'Driscoll, whom ^([sic]) he knew was wont to boast of his Milesian lineage; […]"
                            },
